# Speed belongs to each player apart (CR 702.179). Bot1 reaches max speed with Perilous Snare and Lightning Bolts on turns
# 1, 3 and 5 (CR 704.5aa, 702.179d) and uses the Snare's max speed ability on its Ornithopter. On turn 6 Bot2 takes the
# Snare with Dack Fayden: a player with no speed who controls a permanent with start your engines! gets speed 1, gaining
# control included (CR 702.179a; the rulings), and Bot2's Bolt at Bot1 during its own turn raises it to 2. Bot1 keeps
# speed 4: losing control of the permanent changes nothing (the rulings). The max speed ability is the Snare's
# controller's to have (CR 702.178a: "your speed"), so on turn 8, untapped in Bot2's main phase with a creature of Bot2's
# to target, it is not offered to Bot2 at speed 2, though the Snare's owner has max speed.

